{"id":"wb-5-310","name":"时思寺","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"时思寺","text":"时思寺位于中国浙江省丽水市景宁畲族自治县大漈乡西二村，2001年被列为第五批全国重点文物保护单位。\n\n时思寺始建于元至正十六年（1356年），明末清初续建。平面近长方形，南北长66米，东西宽57米，由山门、钟楼、大殿、三清殿、马仙宫、梅氏宗祠等建筑组成，建筑面积1250平方米。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E6%97%B6%E6%80%9D%E5%AF%BA","revisionId":84933007,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=84933007","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/f58594850285b0cb665106d1.jpg","title":"时思寺国保立碑.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:%E6%97%B6%E6%80%9D%E5%AF%BA%E5%9B%BD%E4%BF%9D%E7%AB%8B%E7%A2%91.jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/8/87/%E6%97%B6%E6%80%9D%E5%AF%BA%E5%9B%BD%E4%BF%9D%E7%AB%8B%E7%A2%91.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"三猎","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0","caption":"​时思寺国保立碑。","width":320,"height":213}}